# Sample requests for local-api-check.
# Click "▶ Send Request" above a block to run it.
# {{variables}} come from the active environment in .api-env/ — see the status bar.

### Get a todo
GET {{base_url}}/todos/{{todo_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a post
POST {{base_url}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test User",
  "body": "hello from local-api-check",
  "userId": 1
}
